  <History Date="09-01-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="30-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added dimmer curve attribute and changed dimmer to 16bit in all modes in line with documentation supplied by customer." />
  <History Date="30-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed red, green, blue and white to 16bit in Extended mode in line with documentation supplied by customer." />
  <History Date="30-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised channel counts in mode names to reflect changes above." />
  <History Date="02-09-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Re-added version 1 modes in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="29-12-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase mode ID's." />
